From 039d841f2930198b148e585fcbf0c4987cb1ab39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:14:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add glass key style

A custom drawable for keys: translucent body, sheen, specular rim and soft
shadow, enabled by a new "Glass key style" switch (needs key border). Also
lowers the default glass blur radius to 16dp.
